Jesus said, "I will go and heal him."
The leader replied, "Sir, I am not qualified to host you in my home. But, all you have to do is speak the word, and my servant will be healed."
I myself am a man under authority. And I have soldiers under my command who obey my orders. If I tell someone this, 'Go,' then he goes. If I tell someone this, 'Come here,' then he comes near. I tell my servant, 'Do this,' then he does it."
